       [#D7D7AF][/dim]cursor's task contributes an I Block ID row, and copy.templates in [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]~/.config/bob/config.yml adds rows such as \"the ^{block_id} task in[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the {path}\". Preview and clipboard never disagree, and copying [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]never writes the vault.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]cmd_y_copy_card.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/cmd_y_copy_card.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-kc[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-kc/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Pure Copy card model, template grammar, and config loader[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]model[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]model: add Obsidian-free fragments for the row table, the owning-task [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolver, the single-pass template grammar, copy.templates loading and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]validation, the frozen card model, and key resolution, with exhaustive [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unit tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Copy card modal, Cmd+Y wiring, styles, and docs[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]card[dim] · [dim][/dim]after model[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]card: replace YankPathPickerModal with a CopyCardModal on Bob's key-card[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tokens, wire Cmd+Y and a yank-block-id palette command through a new [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugin mixin, add the styles, render and key tests, the copy-card docs [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]page, then build and sync.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Real-Obsidian e2e, light and dark screenshots, and polish[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]e2e[dim] · [dim][/dim]after card[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]e2e: drive the card in an isolated scratch vault over CDP, assert the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]clipboard for every key and state, capture light and dark screenshots of[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]each state, and fix whatever the screenshots show is misaligned, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]clipped, or low-contrast.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Ship the Task ref template and document copy.templates[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]config[dim] · [dim][/dim]after card[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]config: add the copy.templates block with the Task ref template to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]chezmoi's Bob config and apply it, and add a copy section to bob-cli's [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]configuration reference that links the plugin page.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-kc","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-kc.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-5f1908376bea1bc1e39526d83d704914","started_at":"2026-11-11T16:22:30.046969+00:00","state":"completed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kc","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kc.1","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kc.2","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kc.3","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kc.4","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kc.land"]}
